        "description": "BizOne alows you to discover the possibilities of modern one page wordpress theme! You will be able to create and showcase your portfolios, create subscriptions with price tables, build slideshows with pop-up messages. Theme includes awesome portfolio section, where you can show your creative works. You can upload unlimited photos and videos. BizOne is a great choice for sites of photographers, creative people, personal websites and creative agencies. In our theme you'll find everything you need. All of the best features is in our WordPress theme! Use our BizOne and you'll get a great site!"
